like it's something I know by a different
name.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.110
Yeah.

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:50.370
Okay. I, citizen's Assembly is an assembly
of randomly selected citizens convened to

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:55.720
consider a problem, listen to experts and
deliberate with help from some moderators

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.850
and propose a solution. It's kind of like
