00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:02.210
Yeah, right, right, exactly. I was going to
make the analogy to the jury. I mean, listen,

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:06.820
I love the idea in principle and one of the
biggest problems we have, I don't know how

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:11.050
big of a problem it is in Canada, but in the
u s one of the biggest problems we have within

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:16.600
