of. So it also scares me and I understand

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:18.560
like when you go back, you know, to Plato
and see his anti a democracy views, I understand

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:22.830
them. I'm not, I'm not an anti, I'm not against
them ocracy but I understand the problem with

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:28.920
