00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:45.900
can get experts in front of these people,
if you can have moderators, uh, you know,

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:50.050
getting them to discuss in a productive way,
people really do change their minds and come

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:53.540
to Ike, what I think are reasonable solutions
